 1874 005170             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 1875 005170             ! TJEXP2 -- horizontal 2x expansion.
 1876 005170             !
 1877 005170             ! Input:
 1878 005170             !       R30/R31 = source byte count (24 or 32)
 1879 005170             !       R32/R33 = absolute source pointer
