 1881 005170             !       TJSBUF contains 2*count bytes.
 1882 005170             !
 1883 005170             ! Each nibble is expanded through DUP4, where every source bit becomes
 1884 005170             ! two adjacent output bits.  High nibble is emitted before low nibble.
