 1985 005430             ! ============================================================
 1986 005430             ! SII / EPSON DRIVER 2 -- v0.10i eight-row batched raster output
 1987 005430             !
 1988 005430             ! Target hardware:
 1989 005430             !       Seiko Instruments IFD501-01UK-E
 1990 005430             !       CAPD345A 576-dot thermal mechanism
 1991 005430             !
 1992 005430             ! Protocol per output block:
 1993 005430             !       GS v 0 m xL xH 8 0 [eight raster rows]
 1994 005430             !
 1995 005430             ! m=0 : native 203 x 203 dpi
 1996 005430             ! m=3 : printer-native double width + double height
 1997 005430             !
 1998 005430             ! v0.10i keeps the stable v0.10h5 HP-IB/CR16 behaviour but reduces SII
 1999 005430             ! transaction overhead by batching eight adjacent raster rows into each
 2000 005430             ! self-contained GS v 0 command.
 2001 005430             !
 2002 005430             ! Portrait:
 2003 005430             !       24 commands x (8-byte header + 8*32-byte rows)
 2004 005430             !       = 24 x 264-byte transactions
 2005 005430             !
 2006 005430             ! Landscape:
 2007 005430             !       32 commands x (8-byte header + 8*24-byte rows)
 2008 005430             !       = 32 x 200-byte transactions
 2009 005430             !
 2010 005430             ! No HP-IB simple-output transaction remains active while CRT memory is read.
 2011 005430             ! A dedicated 264-byte SIIPKT buffer holds the largest complete command.
 2012 005430             ! ============================================================
 2013 005430             
 2014 005430 230         SIIDRV  BIN
 2015 005431 114 261 233         LDMD R14,=BINTAB
      005434 202 
 2016 005435 120 014 264         LDBD R20,X14,PSOVAL
      005440 346 015 
