 2038 005510             ! ------------------------------------------------------------
 2039 005510             ! SIIPOR -- portrait, 256 x 192 source raster, eight rows per command.
 2040 005510             !
 2041 005510             ! zoom 1: m=0, x=32 bytes, y=8 dots -> 24 blocks
 2042 005510             ! zoom 2: m=3, x=32 bytes, y=8 dots -> 24 blocks, printer-side 2x scale
 2043 005510             !
 2044 005510             ! Each block is built completely in SIIPKT before HPOUT begins:
 2045 005510             !
 2046 005510             !       8-byte GS v 0 header
 2047 005510             !       8 x 32-byte CRT rows = 256 bytes
 2048 005510             !       total = 264 decimal bytes
 2049 005510             !
